{
  "Npcs.Mora.Desc": "This is a thin, bony demon with mottled ashen skin, [if (nofur) {sunken, pathetic eyes|a brow that swoops down her nose in a vaguely antelope shape}], and dark hair parted by two horns that twist as the come together at their ends. Her \"wings\" hang tattered and limp from the bones like the branches of a willow, only serving to frame her feeble-looking form, and her tail is like a large feather that gently sweeps away her prints. Recessed eyes stare mournfully at you, but her stained claws ward against letting your guard down. She is garbed in a simple and cheap-looking linen dress that covers little."
  "Npcs.Mora.Name": "Mora"
}
